  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "section": "title",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "Fixture Robotics ships its FX-1 warehouse arm to a second plant",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "section": "description",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "Fixture Robotics has begun shipping the FX-1 arm, rated for 12 kg, to a second Brindle Logistics plant at Tarnmoor.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-1",
        "c-8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "section": "opening",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "Fixture Robotics has begun shipping its FX-1 warehouse arm to a second plant run by Brindle Logistics, at Tarnmoor.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "section": "opening",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "The first site, at Ashvale, now runs 40 of the arms, and a third site is planned.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-23",
        "c-26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "section": "opening",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "The company also reported a $450 million funding round, led by Corvane Partners, in a regulatory filing.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-17",
        "c-18"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "section": "takeaways",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "Tarnmoor is the second Brindle Logistics plant to receive FX-1 arms.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "section": "takeaways",
      "paragraph": 1,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "The datasheet lists a 12 kg rated payload and a 1.4 m maximum reach.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-8",
        "c-9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "section": "takeaways",
      "paragraph": 2,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "Brindle Logistics measured an 18% cut in cycle time at Ashvale.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "section": "takeaways",
      "paragraph": 3,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "The filing dates the first sale of the $450 million round to 29 September 2026.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-16",
        "c-17"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "Fixture Robotics announced on 1 October 2026 that deliveries of the FX-1 warehouse arm to Brindle Logistics have started at Tarnmoor, the customer's second plant.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-1",
        "c-2"
      ],
      "heading": "What shipped"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "The company says the arm is built for tote picking and trailer unloading.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-1"
      ],
      "heading": "What shipped"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "It also says the arm mounts on existing conveyor frames without a new safety cage.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-3"
      ],
      "heading": "What shipped"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "Fixture Robotics lists the arm from $38,000, with delivery within 12 weeks of an order.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-4"
      ],
      "heading": "What shipped"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 1,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "The datasheet lists a rated payload of 12 kg at full reach and a maximum reach of 1.4 m from the base.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-8",
        "c-9"
      ],
      "heading": "What shipped"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 1,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "Peak tool speed is 2.3 m/s, and repeatability is 0.05 mm.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-10",
        "c-11"
      ],
      "heading": "What shipped"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 1,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "The same document gives a throughput of up to 1,200 picks an hour.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-12"
      ],
      "heading": "What shipped"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 1,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "The arm itself weighs 38 kg and draws 650 W in typical use.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-13",
        "c-14"
      ],
      "heading": "What shipped"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 1,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "It lists an ingress protection rating of IP54, which the company describes as suitable for dusty warehouse floors.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-15"
      ],
      "heading": "What shipped"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 2,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "At Ashvale, the first Brindle Logistics plant, 40 FX-1 arms are now running.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-23"
      ],
      "heading": "What shipped"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 2,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "Tarnmoor is due to receive 60 arms by 30 November 2026.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-5"
      ],
      "heading": "What shipped"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 2,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "Brindle Logistics plans to use the arms at Tarnmoor for inbound trailer unloading.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-25"
      ],
      "heading": "What shipped"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "At Ashvale, Brindle Logistics measured an 18% cut in cycle time on its tote-picking cells.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-20"
      ],
      "heading": "What the customer reports"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "It compared the four weeks before and after the arms went live.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-20"
      ],
      "heading": "What the customer reports"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "The installation at Ashvale went live on 18 August 2026, according to Brindle Logistics.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-24"
      ],
      "heading": "What the customer reports"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "\"We went from pilot to production in nine weeks,\" said Dana Whitcombe, chief operating officer of Brindle Logistics.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-22"
      ],
      "heading": "What the customer reports"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 1,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "Across the same weeks, Ashvale averaged 940 picks an hour per arm.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-21"
      ],
      "heading": "What the customer reports"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 1,
      "kind": "analysis",
      "text": "The measured rate sits below the datasheet maximum, which is normal for a figure quoted as an upper limit.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-21",
        "c-12"
      ],
      "heading": "What the customer reports"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 1,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "At a demo day on 24 September 2026, Fixture Robotics showed an FX-1 arm unloading mixed cartons from a trailer.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-27",
        "c-28"
      ],
      "heading": "What the customer reports"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 1,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "The demonstration took place in the company's three-bay test hall.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-28"
      ],
      "heading": "What the customer reports"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 2,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "Brindle Logistics plans to add a third site in 2027.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-26"
      ],
      "heading": "What the customer reports"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 2,
      "kind": "analysis",
      "text": "The customer's results and the company's schedule together describe a rollout that is still at an early stage.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-21",
        "c-26"
      ],
      "heading": "What the customer reports"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "The round, led by Corvane Partners, totals $450 million, according to a regulatory filing.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-17",
        "c-18"
      ],
      "heading": "What the filing shows"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "The filing records the first sale on 29 September 2026.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-16"
      ],
      "heading": "What the filing shows"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "It lists 7 investors in the round.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-19"
      ],
      "heading": "What the filing shows"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 1,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "Fixture Robotics said it will use the funds to expand FX-1 production.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-7"
      ],
      "heading": "What the filing shows"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 1,
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": "It expects to build 500 FX-1 arms in 2027.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-6"
      ],
      "heading": "What the filing shows"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "section": "body",
      "paragraph": 1,
      "kind": "analysis",
      "text": "The stated use of the funds matches the production plan that the company describes.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-7",
        "c-6"
      ],
      "heading": "What the filing shows"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "section": "limitations",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "limitation",
      "text": "The 12 kilograms payload, 1.4 metres reach, 2.3 metres per second top speed and 0.05 mm repeatability figures come from the company's datasheet; no independent measurement was available.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-8",
        "c-9",
        "c-10",
        "c-11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "section": "limitations",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "limitation",
      "text": "The 1.2k pick rate, 38 kg arm mass, 650 W power draw and ingress protection figures come from the company's datasheet; no independent measurement was available.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-12",
        "c-13",
        "c-14",
        "c-15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "section": "limitations",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "limitation",
      "text": "The Tarnmoor shipment, announcement date, retrofit mounting and $38,000 list price figures come from a company press release; no independent measurement was available.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-1",
        "c-2",
        "c-3",
        "c-4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "section": "limitations",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "limitation",
      "text": "The 60 Tarnmoor delivery schedule, 500 production plan, use of funds and pilot-to-production time figures come from a company press release; no independent measurement was available.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-5",
        "c-6",
        "c-7",
        "c-22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "section": "limitations",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "limitation",
      "text": "The 40 Ashvale installation, Ashvale go-live date, Tarnmoor use and third-site rollout figures come from a company press release; no independent measurement was available.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-23",
        "c-24",
        "c-25",
        "c-26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "section": "limitations",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "limitation",
      "text": "The trailer unloading and demo day were shown in a demonstration; the source does not describe independent testing.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-27",
        "c-28"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "section": "limitations",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "limitation",
      "text": "The trailer unloading and demo day were demonstrated; the source does not report them in commercial deployment.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-27",
        "c-28"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "section": "limitations",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "limitation",
      "text": "The Tarnmoor delivery schedule, production plan, use of funds and Tarnmoor use are planned, not delivered.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-5",
        "c-6",
        "c-7",
        "c-25"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "section": "limitations",
      "paragraph": 0,
      "kind": "limitation",
      "text": "The third-site rollout is planned, not delivered.",
      "claimIds": [
        "c-26"
      ]
    }
